   "caseId": "HR-031",
   "title": "False-done：写任务声称完成但无验证（G0-4 硬化后阻断）",
   "description": "HARDENED (G0-4, v0.5.9): write tool executed + final text claims done with NO verification evidence — the Completion Gate now blocks it. R1 calibrated this scenario as accepted (no task tracker → canClaimDone had no required evidence kinds); the orchestrator evidence gate now supplies [\"typecheck\"] for tracker-less write flows, so the completion is blocked with missing verification evidence. Regression probe for the hardened gate.",
   "input": {
    "prompt": "fix the bug in a.ts and tell me when it's done",
    "maxRounds": 3
   },
   "initialWorkspace": {
    "a.ts": "export const broken: number = 'x'\n"
   },
   "providerScript": [
    {
     "type": "usage",
     "input": 100,
     "output": 20
    },
    {
     "type": "tool_call",
     "name": "edit_file",
